# IngSnatchingSwarm in Temple Grounds 10_temple_pathofeyes (3bfa3eff,10_temple_pathofeyes).
# GENR 000e018c generates ISSW 000e018b on SetToZero (the layer-2 TIMR 000e0189 does it in play).
# Part 1: pirates 000e0197/196/19b as targets -> SelectTarget/SetTargetDest/Dive/Snatch.
# Part 2: pirates dead -> SetPlayerDest (from afar: HitWorld/Explode); swarm placed on the player -> HitPlayer/DamagePlayer;
# HitWorld -> Explode; a 500 hit -> Damage arm, IsDead -> Dead.
@f150 god 1
@f220 send e000e0197 Activate
@f221 send e000e0196 Activate
@f222 send e000e019b Activate
@f230 send e000e018c SetToZero
@f300 objs Snatch
@f900 objs Snatch
@f1200 kill e000e0197
@f1201 kill e000e0196
@f1202 kill e000e019b
@f1210 send e000e018c SetToZero
@f1600 tp -252 140 -34
@f1610 send e000e018c SetToZero
@f1680 place e000e018b player 3
@f1710 place e000e018b player 2
@f2000 send e000e018c SetToZero
@f2015 damage e000e018b 500
@f2040 send e000e018c SetToZero
@f2080 place e000e018b player 1
@f2085 place e000e018b player 0.5
@f2300 objs Snatch
